      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu ali'genihwa na v'amalaika v'adatu'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lu'mo mu lyu'v'a, ha itungo lya idu'ta, Abalahamu wav'age ikalile ha muzigo gwa ikutu lyakwe. Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga Abalahamu, bi'hi' na miti' mihanya zya Mamule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wawu'syaga minso gakwe, kasinaga wav'awonaga v'antu' v'adatu' v'i'mile katanalo hado ha mbele yakwe. Haho wav'apeelelaga ku'v'asu'mbi'la, na aho wav'afiki'i'laga wasungamaga ku' isima na ku'yomba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“V'agu'ku' v'anne, ene mukumba winywe nu'mulomba, u'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yinywe muleke ku'mbi'ti'i'la, sumbwa mudi'le mu lu'go lwanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leka galetwe minzi' madoo, ki'gele mukuse magu'lu' ginywe v'ose na musuuhe ha mutaka gwa muti' gwenu'gu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno mwafikaga mu lu'go lwanne, itungo muku'v'a musuuhile nku'v'ezya ki'liwa ki'doo. Mulye, ki'gele mwidibe ku'ya na musi'nzo gwinywe.” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga “Haya, v'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vi wayombaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Abalahamu wangu'haga ku'su'v'a mu ikutu na ku'muwi'la muki' wakwe Sala ati', “V'ezya wangu' ngelo nhanya idatu' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu, u'wu'kanye, na u'v'ezye migate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wangu'haga wangu' ku'ya ku' idale lya ng'ombe, wasogolaga ndogosa yi'mo nsoga na nnonu, wamupaga mukumba wakwe nawe wangu'haga ku'yi'si'nza na ku'yi'teka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ki'liwa chagelani'laga, Abalahamu wasolaga mbowoto, masyu'syu' na nyama yeni'yo, wav'atengelaga v'ageni v'enav'o. Aho v'av'aga v'ali'lya mweni'ki'li' wi'maga bi'hi' nav'o ha nsi'li'li' na muti'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ageni v'enav'o v'amuwu'zyaga Abalahamu, “Muki' wako Sala ali' ku'he?” Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga, “Ali' mu ikutu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yu'mo mugati' nav'o wayombaga, “Nhana ndaku'su'v'i'le mu itungo ki'ti' lyeni'li' mwakizo, nawe Sala alav'e na mwana wa ki'gosya.” Itungo lyeni'lo Sala wav'age i'mile ha muzigo gwa ikutu i'lo lyav'age ku' mpi'ndo gwav'o, apu'li'ki'zizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu na Sala v'asangwa v'akakiku'la, na mu ki'ti'le cha v'aki'ma Sala wav'age wapelile ku'v'yala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Sala wisekelaga mu moyo gwakwe na ku'yomba, “Ene ni' mukiku'lu', na mugosi wanne mukiku'lu', nku'togeziwa vihe ku'lala nawe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henanho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga Abalahamu, “Ku' ki' Sala waseka na kwiwu'zya ati', ‘Yi'ku'kowoleka vihe ku'v'yala mwana ku' wu'kiku'lu' wanne?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vihe, li'li'ho igambo ki' ilambu lya ku'mupota Gu'ku' Mulungu? Ndasu'v'e mu itungo ki'ti' lyeni'li' mwakizo, na Sala alav'e na mwana wa ki'gosya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Sala ku'nguno ya kogoha wayombaga wu'fi ati', “Nkasekile!” Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Ku'du' u'kaane wasekaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu ali'v'alombela v'ikazi v'a Sodoma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ageni v'enav'o aho v'amali'laga ku'lya v'awu'kaga, nawe Abalahamu wav'afili'li'zyaga mpaka ha lwandi' lwa igu'lya u'lo v'akowolile ku'yi'wona kaya ya Sodoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wiganikaga, “Vihe, muv'ise Abalahamu igambo lya ndaka yanne i'yo nu'koov'a ku'v'ezya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno mwenu'yu' alav'e sav'o lya nsi' nhanya na ya nguzu na ku' wakwe makabi'la gose ga mu welelo galadosiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusogolile mweni'ki'li' ki'gele av'ahembeke v'ana v'akwe na wu'v'yalwa wakwe ku'yi'londa nzi'la yanne, v'av'e v'atekanu na ku'v'ezya magambo ga lole ki'gele nanne mugelani'zi'zye ilagano lyanne ki'ti' i'vyo nayombile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “Ku'li' na ki'li'lo ki'hanya ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'a kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola, na wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo nku'sooka ki'gele mbone u'lu' wu'kenagu'zi u'wo v'ali'v'ezya wu'gelani'lile na ki'li'lo i'cho chakansanga. U'lu' yi'kav'ile vyene nku'manya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati' na v'antu' v'enav'o, v'av'i'li' v'adimaga nzi'la ku'ya ku' Sodoma, ali'vi Abalahamu wasigalaga henanho i'mile haki'mo na Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
