              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu wayombaga hangi' ati', “Nagimaga ku'yomba nanho ev'e Gu'ku' wanne ninga i'vi ene ni' lu'wuwu na matunde du'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole maku'mi ane na v'atano, vihe, u'ku'yi'zimangu'zya ku'nguno v'angi'laga v'atano ku' av'o maku'mi atano?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “U'lu' nasanga v'enav'o v'a lole nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
