              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu walambaga ku'yomba hangi', “Hamo v'akowolile kwigela maku'mi ane mwenu'mo?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno yav'o, nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya.”",
          "type": "text",
