            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu walambaga ku'mwikonga, “Ev'e Gu'ku', ku'du' u'gaye, nu'yomba hangi', hamo v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole maku'mi adatu'?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno ya v'enav'o v'a lole nku'leka ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo.”",
          "type": "text",
