              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahamu wayombaga ati', “Nagimaga ku'yomba na Gu'ku' wanne, hamo v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole maku'mi av'i'li'?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno ya v'enav'o maku'mi av'i'li' nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya.”",
          "type": "text",
