              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahi'lo Abalahamu wayombaga ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku', nakwikonga ku'du' u'gaye, sumbwa nu'yomba hangi' kamo du'. Vihe, u'lu' v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole iku'mi yi'ku'v'a vihe?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno ya v'enav'o iku'mi nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya yeni'yo.”",
          "type": "text",
